  "schema:name": "Civil Service List (Active)",
  "schema:description": "A Civil Service List consists of all candidates who passed an exam, ranked in score order. An established list is considered active for no less than one year and no more than four years from the date of establishment. For more information visit DCAS’ “Why You Should Work for the City” webpage at: https://www.nyc.gov/site/dcas/employment/how-can-you-find-upcoming-exams.page. \n\nFor any questions about the civil service list, the civil service process, exams, or this data please contact us at and direct your inquiries to: https://a856-exams.nyc.gov/OASysWeb/contact.",
  "schema:identifier": "vx8i-nprf",
